---
import Avatar from './Avatar.astro';
import Rich from './Rich.astro';
import AiSteps from './AiSteps.astro';
import { people, assistantSession as s } from '../conversation.js';

/**
 * The assistant as its own feature, not a bot in a channel.
 *
 * In the product it is a distinct chat type (`ai_assistant`) with its own header, its
 * own mode switch — advisory "consultation and strategic guidance" versus builder
 * "actively creates sites, lists, and pages" — and its own agent picker. The window
 * below is that surface, so the header chrome here is the assistant's, not a channel's.
 *
 * It co-exists with chat rather than living inside it: the same assistant can be
 * switched on in any conversation. That is stated at the end, deliberately, so the
 * feature is introduced on its own terms first.
 *
 * The demo shares the page's step engine — `[data-demo]` + `[data-beat]` — see
 * DemoEngine.astro.
 */
---

<section class="section" id="assistant">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">AI assistant</span>
      <h2>It does the work first, then answers</h2>
      <p>
        Ask it something and it does not guess from a training set. It searches your
        messages, opens your documents, reads the file you attached — and shows you every
        step it took, how long each one ran, and what it looked at. The answer arrives with
        its working attached.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="split">
      <div class="split-media reveal">
        <div class="demo" data-demo>
          <div class="window">
            <div class="window-bar">
              <span class="window-dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
              <span class="window-title">Assistant</span>
              <span class="tag-demo">Demo</span>
            </div>

            <!-- The assistant chat's own header: which mode it is in, and which agent
                 answers. Both are real controls in the product. -->
            <div class="ai-head">
              <Avatar person={people.assistant} size="sm" />
              <div class="ai-id">
                <p class="ai-name">Assistant</p>
                <p class="ai-sub">Answers from your hub</p>
              </div>
              <span class="chip-mode">{s.mode}</span>
              <span class="chip-agent">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#ai-ic-remember" /></svg>
                {s.agent}
              </span>
            </div>

            <div class="thread-body">
              <article class="beat msg is-mine" data-beat data-wait="1200">
                <div class="col">
                  <div class="bubble">{s.ask}</div>
                </div>
              </article>

              <article class="beat msg is-ai" data-beat data-wait="600">
                <Avatar person={people.assistant} size="sm" />
                <div class="col">
                  <div class="bubble bubble-ai">
                    <AiSteps steps={s.steps} id="assistant" />
                    <div data-beat data-wait="600" data-ai-answer>
                      <p class="body"><Rich text={s.answer} /></p>
                      <p class="cites">
                        {s.citations.map((c) => <span class="cite">{c.label}</span>)}
                      </p>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </article>
            </div>

            <div class="composer" aria-hidden="true"><span>Ask the assistant…</span></div>
          </div>

          <div class="controls" data-controls>
            <button class="ctl ctl-primary" type="button" data-play>
              <span data-play-icon aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <span data-play-label>Pause</span>
            </button>
            <button class="ctl" type="button" data-restart>Restart</button>
            <p class="status">
              <span data-status>Playing</span>
              <span class="status-sep" aria-hidden="true">·</span>
              <span data-count>0 of 0</span>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="split-copy reveal">
        <h3>Why the steps matter</h3>
        <p>
          An assistant that answers instantly is either recalling something generic or
          making it up. One that takes four seconds and tells you it read
          <code>nginx.conf</code> is one you can check — and checking is the difference
          between a useful colleague and a confident stranger.
        </p>
        <ul class="split-list">
          <li>
            <b>Its own tools, on your data.</b> Searching messages and hub content, reading
            an attached file, fetching a page through your own metasearch — each one an
            admin-managed entry in a registry, not a black box
          </li>
          <li>
            <b>Pick who answers.</b> Route automatically, or name a specific agent. An
            endpoint that starts failing drops out of the picker on its own and comes back
            when it recovers
          </li>
          <li>
            <b>Two modes.</b> Advisory consults and explains. Builder actually creates sites,
            lists and pages — and nothing is created until a human approves the plan
          </li>
          <li>
            <b>It remembers, and you can see what.</b> Long-term notes are per person,
            visible, and deletable by the person they are about
          </li>
          <li>
            <b>It reads what you send it.</b> PDF, Word and text for any model; images for
            the models that can see
          </li>
        </ul>

        <div class="callout">
          <h4>Separate from chat, available inside it</h4>
          <p>
            The assistant is its own conversation, with its own history — but the same
            assistant can be switched on inside any channel or direct message, where it
            answers with that conversation as its context. Two features, one hub, and your
            own model endpoints behind both.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .split {
    gap: 52px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .demo {
    min-width: 0;
  }

  /* ── assistant chat header ── */
  .ai-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 12px 15px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--surface);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .ai-id {
    min-width: 0;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .ai-name {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
  }

  .ai-sub {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--text-3);
  }

  .chip-mode,
  .chip-agent {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 5px;
    padding: 3px 10px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    flex: none;
  }

  .chip-mode {
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--violet) 16%, transparent);
    color: var(--violet);
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--violet) 40%, transparent);
  }

  .chip-agent {
    background: var(--surface-2);
    color: var(--text-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
  }

  .chip-agent svg {
    width: 12px;
    height: 12px;
    fill: none;
    stroke: currentColor;
    stroke-width: 2;
  }

  /* ── the exchange ── */
  .thread-body {
    padding: 18px 16px 4px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 14px;
    background: var(--bg-raised);
  }

  :global(.js) [data-beat] {
    opacity: 0.06;
    transform: translateY(9px);
    transition: opacity 0.34s ease, transform 0.34s ease;
  }

  :global(.js) [data-beat].is-shown {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: none;
  }

  .msg {
    display: flex;
    gap: 9px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .msg.is-mine {
    flex-direction: row-reverse;
  }

  .col {
    min-width: 0;
    max-width: 88%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .msg.is-mine .col {
    align-items: flex-end;
  }

  .msg.is-ai .col {
    flex: 1;
  }

  .bubble {
    padding: 9px 14px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    border-bottom-left-radius: 6px;
    background: var(--surface-2);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .msg.is-mine .bubble {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #fff;
    border-bottom-left-radius: 16px;
    border-bottom-right-radius: 6px;
  }

  .bubble-ai {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .body {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.62;
    color: var(--text-2);
  }

  .cites {
    margin-top: 10px;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 7px;
  }

  .cite {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 3px 9px;
    border-radius: 7px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
    color: var(--text-3);
    background: var(--surface-2);
  }

  .cite::before {
    content: "↳ ";
    color: var(--accent-2);
  }

  .composer {
    margin: 10px 16px 16px;
    padding: 9px 14px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: var(--surface);
    font-size: 0.83rem;
    color: var(--text-3);
  }

  /* ── controls ── */
  .controls {
    display: none;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }

  :global(.js) .controls {
    display: flex;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    :global(.js) .controls {
      display: none;
    }
  }

  .ctl {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 7px 14px;
    border-radius: 9px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
    background: var(--surface);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    transition: background 0.15s ease;
  }

  .ctl:hover {
    background: var(--surface-2);
  }

  .ctl-primary {
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 50%, transparent);
    background: var(--accent-soft);
    color: var(--accent-2);
  }

  .ctl [data-play-icon] {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .status {
    margin-left: auto;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--text-3);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }

  .status-sep {
    margin-inline: 6px;
  }

  /* ── copy column ── */
  .split-copy h3 {
    font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 2.5vw, 1.75rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  }

  .split-list b {
    color: var(--text);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .callout {
    margin-top: 26px;
    padding: 18px 20px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--violet) 34%, transparent);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--violet) 8%, var(--surface));
  }

  .callout h4 {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .callout p {
    margin-top: 8px;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: var(--text-2);
    line-height: 1.62;
  }

  @media (max-width: 980px) {
    .split {
      gap: 36px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .thread-body {
      padding: 14px 12px 2px;
    }

    .col {
      max-width: 94%;
    }

    .status {
      width: 100%;
      margin-left: 0;
      order: -1;
    }

    .controls {
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
  }
</style>
